-What?
-Nothing.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:48.040
I'll give this straight back
to you, Mr. Hyodo.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:52.750
Paid off perfectly by your last event.
Now that's a strong finish.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:56.250
-Are you quitting for real, manager?
-We're gonna miss you!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:00.410
In the end,
she wasn't cut out to be an idol.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:04.080
You won't make it if you don't have
a couple of screws loose.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:10.580
Without you, we might need
part-time jobs for a while.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:13.790
But we'll climb our way up again.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.660
Just you watch, Retsuko.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:20.290
I will. Good luck, Manaka.

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.160
I watched the stream.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.700
Did Retsy really play that guitar?

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.870
<i>Let's say it's a trade secret.</i>

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:38.250
Hey, Tadano, I've been wanting
to ask you this for a while now.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.620
<i>Did you tamper with the app?</i>

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.750
What do you mean?

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.660
<i>I mean that thing with Retsuko and Haida.</i>

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:48.040
<i>I don't know a thing about it.</i>

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:54.750
It's impossible
to predict the future, in any case.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:59.410
What's important is believing
in the path you choose and pressing on.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:00.910
Don't you think?

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:08.700
<i>Just count to ten,</i>
<i>and I'll be a diligent little girl.</i>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:12.910
<i>Just count to ten,</i>
<i>and I'll be a diligent office worker.</i>

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.790
<i>Just count to ten,</i>
<i>and I'll be everyone's idol.</i>

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.000
<i>Just count to ten,</i>

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:26.330
<i>and I'll be a mysterious idol producer.</i>

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.870
<i>Just count to ten,</i>

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:33.000
<i>and we can be anything we want.</i>

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:37.250
<i>Just count to ten, and I...</i>

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.000
Hiya.

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:47.620
Say, Retsuko.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.790
Hm?

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.250
Have you eaten yet?

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.500
No.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.790
But I'm about to.

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:15.080
<i>As I’m heading out of class</i>
<i>And I look up to the sky</i>

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:21.120
<i>I hear so many voices just echoing by</i>

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:26.950
<i>I run through the schoolyard</i>
<i>And I’m feeling something new</i>

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:33.700
<i>The scent of a flower</i>
<i>That’s about to bloom</i>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>A secret flower garden</i>
<i>On my uniform</i>

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:47.200
<i>My tail is softly swaying slowly</i>
<i>but surely feelings have formed</i>

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:54.580
<i>My little heart just skips a beat</i>
<i>Each time I look at you</i>

00:22:54.870 --> 00:23:00.370
<i>Colorful as a gummy</i>
<i>And sweet as chocolate cake</i>

00:23:00.910 --> 00:23:06.450
<i>My dreams are candy-coated</i>
<i>I’m not sure what I should do...</i>

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:12.660
<i>Can you mix it together</i>
<i>And make my wishes come true?</i>

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.870
<i>Fuwari Fuwari</i>
<i>Fuwari Fuwari</i>

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:18.910
<i>I really want you to know</i>
<i>I really want you to know</i>

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:22.000
<i>I just wish that you knew…</i>
<i>I just wish that you knew…</i>

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.120
<i>What I wanted to say</i>

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:25.870
Subtitle translation by Rachel Momber
